            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Wonky Pigeon! is a deliberately absurd and clumsy game made as a joke and parody rather than a serious action project.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou play as a pigeon in chaotic and often pointless situations where what happens feels more like a gag or a sketch than traditional gameplay. Controls may feel awkward, physics unpredictable, and the result funny or irritating depending on expectations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWonky Pigeon! is not a polished game with high production quality. Many negative reviews are related to technical roughness and strange controls — this is part of the game's concept and format.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is suitable for those who enjoy absurd humor, treat clumsiness as part of the joke, and are looking for a short and strange game experience without serious expectations.",
            "about_the_game": "Wonky Pigeon! is a deliberately absurd and clumsy game made as a joke and parody rather than a serious action project.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou play as a pigeon in chaotic and often pointless situations where what happens feels more like a gag or a sketch than traditional gameplay. Controls may feel awkward, physics unpredictable, and the result funny or irritating depending on expectations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWonky Pigeon! is not a polished game with high production quality. Many negative reviews are related to technical roughness and strange controls — this is part of the game's concept and format.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is suitable for those who enjoy absurd humor, treat clumsiness as part of the joke, and are looking for a short and strange game experience without serious expectations.",
            "short_description": "A deliberately absurd joke game about chaos, strange physics, and awkward situations. Not a serious action game, but a short humorous experience without pretension.",
